NC2 tied-core (regular/Paley) channel weights W(m)=sum_i m!/(i!^2(m-2i)!):
  [1, 3, 7, 19, 51, 141, 393, 1107, 3139, 8953, 25653, 73789]
  = A002426 central trinomial = [x^0](1+x+1/x)^m = moments of 3-atom free convolution
  ratio W(m)/W(m-1) -> 2.8764 (-> 3); growth ~3^m/sqrt(pi m); free-prob/Wigner (THM-438)
